From: YunPin Maintainers <yunpin@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Refresh the private Rime userdb snapshot on demand

Restore only Rime's local maintenance snapshot hook.  The desktop sync agent
supplies a random request nonce and waits for a fixed, private acknowledgement
written only after librime's maintenance thread has joined.  Maintenance is
deferred while any registered controller is composing, chording, re-entrant,
or recently active.  Idle controllers invalidate their session IDs before
librime cleanup.  Deploy and finalize paths likewise invalidate every live
controller-owned session ID before global teardown, so allocator address reuse
cannot cross controller ownership.  No path, relay credential, endpoint, or
network operation enters the input method.
